Demo sticker assets
===================

Everything under stickers/demo/ is original artwork generated by
tools/make_demo_pack.py and is released under CC0-1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). You may use, modify and
redistribute it without attribution.

Third-party packs
=================

This repository intentionally ships no third-party sticker packs. Imported
packs keep their own licenses and authors; check each pack's manifest.json
before redistributing it. The MIT license in LICENSE covers the code only.
